"40191733"], "CSF1R": ["40154882"]}, "GEN": 1}, "HUMAN_COMMON:0000046": {"L": "chondrocyte", "T": "class", "P": ["HUMAN_COMMON:0000071"], "R": ["COMP", "FRZB"], "S": [], "N": ["PTPRC", "COL1A1"], "D": null, "DF": ["COL9A3", "ACAN", "SOX9", "COL9A1", "COL2A1"], "A": [], "MP": [], "GM": {"COL9A3": ["36380336"], "ACAN": ["27771362"], "SOX9": ["31382142", "27771362"], "COL9A1": ["24655005"], "COL2A1": ["27771362"], "COMP": ["24655005"], "FRZB": ["30026257"]}, "GEN": 1}}, "cp": [["chondrocyte vs perichondrial fibroblast", [], "CHAD/CYTL1 are shared: Madissoon 2023 (36543915) lists them for human airway chondrocytes, Calyeca 2025 (39836476) lists Chad/Cytl1 as perichondral fibroblast (PC-Fb) markers in mouse trachea after removing chondrocytes. Discriminators: chondrocyte = ACAN + COL9A3 (cartilage ECM); perichondrial fibroblast = COL12A1 + fibroblast collagens, ACAN/COL9A3-low."], ["hillock cell vs suprabasal cell", [], "Both are KRT13+/KRT4+ children of the basal class. Ruiz Garcia 2019 (PMID 31558434) defines supraBCs as KRT5+/TP63-/KRT13+/KRT4+; the human hillock (PMID 38693267) is a stratified squamous KRT13+ patch sitting on KRT13+/TP63+ BASAL cells. TP63 is the encoded discriminator (negative on suprabasal)."], ["submucosal gland myoepithelial cell vs airway smooth muscle cell", [], "Both are ACTA2/TAGLN/CNN1 positive. Madissoon 2023 (PMID 36543915): myoepithelial cells express basal-epithelial TP63 and KRT14 and are DES NEGATIVE, whereas smooth muscle is DES+/MYH11+ and TP63-/KRT14-."], ["submucosal gland duct cell vs submucosal gland serous cell", ["submucosal gland serous cell"], "Madissoon 2023 (PMID 36543915): duct cells are ALDH1A3+/MIA+/RARRES1+ (smFISH-validated), serous cells are LPO+/RARRES1-. CCL28 and MHC-II are shared by both and cannot separate them."], ["submucosal gland mucous cell vs surface mucus secreting / goblet cell", ["mucus secreting cell", "submucosal gland mucous cell"], "Both are MUC5B-dominant. Goldfarbmuren 2020 (PMID 32427931): SMG cells uniquely express SOX9 plus the lacrimal-gland TFs FOXC1 and BARX2, while the SURFACE mucus secretory program is CREB3L1/SPDEF (and MUC5AC-high)."], ["deuterosomal cell vs multiciliated cell vs cycling basal cell", [], "Ruiz Garcia 2019 (PMID 31558434): deuterosomal cells express MCC genes AND cell-cycle genes (CENPF, PTTG1, CDK1), so they are mis-read either as mature ciliated cells or as proliferating basal cells. DEUP1/CDC20B/FOXN4/HES6 are deuterosome-specific; mature MCCs are DEUP1-protein negative."], ["pulmonary tuft cell vs ionocyte", ["tuft cell"], "Goldfarbmuren 2020 (PMID 32427931): tuft-like and ionocyte cells share 107 genes including ASCL3, and 'FOXI1 ... was expressed by roughly half of POU2F3+ tuft-like cells', but 'these tuft-like cells mostly lacked detectable CFTR'. FISH: FOXI1+CFTR+POU2F3- = ionocyte, FOXI1+CFTR-POU2F3+ = tuft-like."]], "oq": ["HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000039", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000005", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000035", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000001", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000033", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000031", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000032", "HUMAN_TRACHEA:0000038"], "ca": [], "sa": [{"name": "proliferating", "markers": ["MKI67", "TOP2A", "CCNB1", "CENPF"], "pmids": ["12058064"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["tissue-resident macrophage", "basal keratinocyte", "fibroblast", "cancer-associated fibroblast", "T cell", "CD8-positive, alpha-beta T cell", "microglial cell", "endothelial cell", "basal prostate epithelial cell", "myeloid cell"]}, {"name": "senescent", "markers": ["CDKN1A", "CDKN2A", "GLB1", "SERPINE1"], "pmids": ["29477613"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": ["myoepithelial cell", "adipocyte"]}, {"name": "stemness", "markers": ["ALDH1A1", "CD44"], "pmids": ["12629218", "18371393"], "applies_to": ["epithelial cell"], "mimics": [], "anchor_markers": [], "of": []}, {"name": "heat-shock response", "markers": ["HSPA1A", "HSP90AA1", "DNAJB1"], "pmids": ["27502399"], "applies_to": [], "mimics": [], "anchor_marke